<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clĭma</span></b> , ătis
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abl. plur.</i>
			climatis, Firm. Math. 2, 13), n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίμα</span> (prop. the inclination, slope; hence, cf.
			Lidd. and Scott under <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίμα</span>, II.),
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A clime</i>, <i>climate</i> (late
			Lat.), <i><span class="en">App. Trism. p. 98, 23</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 8, § 859</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Anim. 49</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. G. 1, 246</span></i> (in
				<i><span class="en">Vitr.
				1, 1, 10</span></i>, used as Greek).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In gen. for <i>region</i>, <i>part</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clima medium ventris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Act. Vet. 1, 43, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A land measure of</i> 60 <i>feet
				square</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 5, 1, 5</span></i>.* †
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clīmăcis</span></b> ,
			ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλιμακίς</span>, <i>a small
				staircase</i> or <i>ladder</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10,
				11, 8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
